# {{PROJECT_NAME}} - Epilogue
# The convergence point — story branches route here via [goto] when they finish.
# Arc chain: prologue → branch(es) → epilogue (this file).
# Replace the placeholder content with your ending scene, credits, or post-game sequence.
# For branching endings, use [if] blocks to check variables set during the story.
# [end] at the bottom terminates the session and returns to the main menu.

@scenario {{SCENARIO_PREFIX}}_epilogue
@include {{CHARACTERS_INCLUDE}}

# ─── Epilogue Scene ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The player arrives here after completing a branch. Write your ending here.
# To show different endings based on player choices, use conditional blocks:
#   [if courage >= 3]
#   Lavender: You were brave.
#   [else]
#   Lavender: You were cautious.
#   [endif]

@label start
[show lavender center {{LAVENDER_EXPR}}]
narrator: This is the epilogue arc — the end of the story chain.
narrator: All branches converge here. Replace this content with your ending scene.

# ─── End ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [end] terminates the game session and returns to the main menu.
# You can show credits, unlock content, or [goto] a post-game scene before calling [end].

[end]
